zaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQmxhY2stU2FpbHMtJTI4MjAxNC0lMjkv"}],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVHJveS1GYWxsLW9mLWEtQ2l0eS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxOCUyOS8.1.1","title":"Black Blood","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2018-02-17T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Following a fateful encounter with the gods, the life of young herdsman Paris changes forever. At the Troy city games, he discovers something extraordinary, and on a trip to Sparta, he falls in love with unpredictable and far-reaching consequences.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qclF5f46uRXhVIdoVBVXncB1cLS.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVHJveS1GYWxsLW9mLWEtQ2l0eS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxOCUyOS8.1.2","title":"Conditions","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2018-02-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The elopement of Helen and Paris causes chaos for the Greeks and the Trojans. Priam and Hecuba debate whether to send Helen back or risk the consequences. The goddess Artemis presents Agamemnon with an even more agonising dilemma.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/18WvVSgVf5CWVklsEWGB4BZRcS8.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVHJveS1GYWxsLW9mLWEtQ2l0eS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxOCUyOS8.1.3","title":"Siege","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2018-03-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With the Greeks' grip on the city tightening, Hector and Paris embark on a dangerous journey to a nearby ally to ask for help. Relying on each other for survival tests and strengthens their bond, but a familiar face reappears to tell Hector the disturbing truth about his brother.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gPHqmiXjhp1NXevWhcfMZ4ZmHYf.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVHJveS1GYWxsLW9mLWEtQ2l0eS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxOCUyOS8.1.4","title":"Spoils of War","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2018-03-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Achilles' shock attack on Troy's ally Cilicia devastates the Trojans and puts the spotlight on Helen. Andromache receives both good news and bad. A bitter dispute erupts between Agamemnon and Achilles.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ppWvAQLlcpnylQ9bmVlPdU2CD0C.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVHJveS1GYWxsLW9mLWEtQ2l0eS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxOCUyOS8.1.5","title":"Hunted","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2018-03-17T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Paris is hunted by the Greeks and returns to his former life, leaving Helen without an ally in Troy just as Pandarus's investigation gathers momentum. The Trojans attempt to take advantage of the divisions within the Greek camp.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yBjpjuoNuCackWcf8QFfBaxtwZw.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVHJveS1GYWxsLW9mLWEtQ2l0eS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxOCUyOS8.1.6","title":"Battle on the Beach","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2018-03-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The Trojans receive a message from the gods and embark on a daring raid with new allies. Helen's situation remains precarious. Achilles is provoked into returning to battle.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eJWWBGLgdpmBGfauF13g33unE4O.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVHJveS1GYWxsLW9mLWEtQ2l0eS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxOCUyOS8.1.7","title":"Twelve Days","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2018-03-31T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"King Priam takes his life into his hands to visit Achilles and a truce is agreed, but will it hold? Helen faces a personal crisis as her relationship with Paris comes under strain.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nKEiToaX479G4ydRXQOREpYLomU.jpg"}]}}